## 9. Output Requirements

The expected output is a properly populated Employee Test table containing the imported employee records.

## 10. Requirement Summary

The Requirement Analysis Phase defines the resources, data, functions, and conditions required to implement the project successfully.

These requirements are used as the foundation for the Design and Planning phases.
